  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-native-american-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-native-american-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-native-american-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>1010-8</td><td>Apache</td></tr><tr><td>4111-1</td><td>Aztec</td></tr><tr><td>1035-5</td><td>Blackfeet</td></tr><tr><td>1088-4</td><td>Cherokee</td></tr><tr><td>1102-3</td><td>Cheyenne</td></tr><tr><td>1123-9</td><td>Chippewa</td></tr><tr><td>1155-1</td><td>Choctaw</td></tr><tr><td>3109-6</td><td>Comanche</td></tr><tr><td>1340-9</td><td>Lumbee</td></tr><tr><td>1833-3</td><td>Lingít (Tlingit)</td></tr><tr><td>4093-1</td><td>Mayan</td></tr><tr><td>3321-7</td><td>Navajo</td></tr><tr><td>1407-6</td><td>Osage</td></tr><tr><td>1609-7</td><td>Sioux</td></tr><tr><td>4178-0</td><td>Taino</td></tr><tr><td>1896-0</td><td>Yu’pik Eskimo</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-background-codes</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>9999-1</td><td>Athabascan</td></tr><tr><td>9999-2</td><td>Haudenosaunee</td></tr><tr><td>9999-3</td><td>Inupiat</td></tr><tr><td>9999-4</td><td>Muscogee (Eastern, Lower, Star Clan) </td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
